  (text "REFERENCE ONLY - logical mapping for future adapter PCBs, not additional live targets" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 28 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "bb64bc9c-1353-5242-b502-81924eb5073e"))
  (text "Intel 2716: VPP pin21 must be +5V for READ. NOT VPP_SW=0V.\nRead adapter ties pin21 to TARGET_VCC; pin18 = CE, pin20 = OE.\nFuture WRITE needs a relay/jumper to select pin21 between +5V and VPP_SW;\nseparate exact algorithm and polarity are required. Do not copy NM27C512 WRITE.\nKR573RF5 profile is quarantined pending a traceable original device datasheet.\nIts manufacturer pinout/algorithm must be checked before populating an adapter.\n2732 differs: pin21 = A11 and pin20 = OE/VPP (requires HV isolation)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20 163 0) (effects (font (size 1.45 1.45)) (justify left)) (uuid "cf829bcb-4fd8-5221-a5ed-2665c2e69d6b"))
